    "updated_at": "2024-10-18T22:03:41Z",
    "body": "> One question I have, does the invoker that's passed work even if it's in a shadow root?\r\n\r\nGood question. Based on the fact that there's no way to imperatively retrieve the invoker (right?) and obviously if you're passing it in, you have knowledge of it, then I'd say that should be ok?",
